---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "headline": "The Ultimate Guide to AI in Customer Service 2026",
      "description": "Discover how AI is transforming customer service. Complete guide on chatbots, automation, and extreme personalization.",
      "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "GetNexo" },
      "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "GetNexo" },
      "datePublished": "2026-01-21",
      "image": "/images/blog/guia_ia_atendimento_2026.png"
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="AI in Customer Service 2026 | GetNexo"
  articleSchema={schema}
  type="article"
>
  <article class="post-container">
    <header class="post-header">
      <div class="meta">Strategy • Jan 2026</div>
      <h1>AI in Customer Service:<br/><span class="text-primary">The Ultimate 2026 Guide</span></h1>
      <p class="subtitle">How Generative AI is redefining customer loyalty and operational efficiency.</p>
      <img src="/images/blog/guia_ia_atendimento_2026.png" alt="AI in Customer Service" class="featured-image" />
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <section id="introducao">
        <h2>🚀 The Silent AI Revolution</h2>
        <p>In 2026, customer service is no longer about answering questions; it's about predicting needs. Artificial Intelligence has stopped being an accessory to become the main engine of the fastest-growing companies.</p>
        <div class="glass-panel mt-8">
          <p><strong>Highlight:</strong> Companies utilizing Generative AI in 2025 saw a 40% increase in customer satisfaction (CSAT) and a 35% reduction in cost per ticket.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="chatbots-agentes">
        <h2>🤖 From Chatbots to Virtual Agents</h2>
        <p>The evolution from traditional chatbots to Predictive Virtual Agents has changed the game. While the old chatbot followed a rigid flow, GetNexo's Virtual Agent understands context, nuance, and sentiment.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="final-cta">
        <h3>Transform your service today!</h3>
        <p>The technology for the future of your business is already available at GetNexo.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons mt-8">
          <a href="/en/create-bot" class="btn-primary">Get Started Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
/* Reusing styles from original post */
  .post-container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .post-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: white; }
  .text-primary { color: #00f7ff; }
  .subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #a0a0a0; }
  .featured-image { width: 100%; border-radius: 24px; margin-top: 3rem; }
  .post-content { color: #ccc; line-height: 1.8; }
  h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; color: white; margin: 4rem 0 2rem; }
  .glass-panel { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 24px; }
  .final-cta { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 247, 255, 0.1), rgba(112, 0, 255, 0.1)); padding: 5rem 2rem; text-align: center; border-radius: 32px; border: 1px solid #00f7ff; }
  .btn-primary { background: #00f7ff; color: black; padding: 1.2rem 3.5rem; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800; }
</style>
